return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:36:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:36:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','For sites hosted with Zinn Digital®. Controls the page cache your Zinn® server already provides — smart auto-purge on content change, remote purge from your Zinn® dashboard, a Redis object-cache toggle, safe WordPress/WooCommerce exclusions, and one-click admin login. This is a cache controller, not a cache engine. Hosting elsewhere? Install Zinn® Cache Engine instead.'=>'Don shafukan da aka karɓi baƙon su a Zinn Digital®. Yana sarrafa cache ɗin shafin da uwar garken ku na Zinn® ke bayarwa riga - tsaftace atomatik mai wayo yayin canjin abun ciki, tsaftace nesa daga dashboard ɗin ku na Zinn®, maɓallin rabe-rabe na abu na Redis, keɓewar WordPress/WooCommerce amintattu, da shiga admin da dannawa ɗaya. Wannan mai sarrafa cache ne, ba injin cache ba. Ana karɓar baƙon wani wuri? Sanya Zinn® Cache Engine maimakon haka.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Ma\'ajiyar wucin gadi','Page cache'=>'Taskar shafin','Object cache'=>'Ma\'ajiyar Abu','Purging'=>'Ana sharewa','Exclusions'=>'Banbance-banbance','Purge everything now'=>'Tsaftace komai yanzu','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'An cire kowane shafi da aka adana a madubi kuma za a sake gina su yayin da baƙi ke zuwa. Ka ci gaba?','Full-page cache'=>'Caching shafi gaba ɗaya','Served by LiteSpeed at the web server, before WordPress runs. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'LiteSpeed ce ke sarrafa shi a matsayin uwar garken yanar gizo, kafin WordPress ya fara aiki. Nan ne kusan duk saurin yake fitowa.','Send LiteSpeed cache-control and tag headers on cacheable pages'=>'Aika da kanzon LiteSpeed da tag headers a shafukan da za a iya sanyawa a cache','How long a page stays cached'=>'Tsawon lokacin da shafi ke kasancewa a adana a cikin cache','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Daƙiƙa. Mako ɗaya ya dace da yawancin shafuka; gidan yanar gizon labarai da ke wallafawa a kowace awa yana buƙatar kaɗan sosai.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Tsawon lokacin da burauzar baƙo ke riƙe hotuna da rubutun shirin','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Daƙiƙa. Ana amfani da shi kawai ga hotuna, CSS da JavaScript — ba ga shafuka ba. Sanya zuwa 0 don barin wannan ga mai masaukin baki na ku.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Masu ziyara da suka shiga','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Kada ka taba ba da shafi da aka adana a madubi ga mai ziyara da ya shiga ciki','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'On shine amintaccen amsa kuma tsohuwar siga ta asali. Kashe shi kawai idan ka san cewa kowane shafi da aka adana a madubi iri ɗaya ne ga kowane mai amfani da ya shiga - rukunin membobi shine dalilin da ya saba sa ba a yin hakan.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Rayuwa daban-daban don abubuwa daban-daban','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Misali: shafukan samfur na wani shago na tsawon awa guda, yayin da komai zai kasance na tsawon mako guda.','Add a rule'=>'Sanya doka','Content type'=>'Nau\'in abun ciki','Seconds'=>'Dakiku','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Cache na abu (Redis)','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Yana adana sakamakon binciken bayanan rumbu. Yana taimakawa sosai a kan kantin da ke da aiki sosai ko kuma wani shafi mai yawan baƙi da suka shiga, inda ma\'ajiyar shafi ba za ta iya ba.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Shigar da Redis object-cache drop-in','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'Yana buƙatar ƙarin phpredis. Idan babu shi, akwatin da ke sama da wannan allo zai nuna hakan.','Redis host'=>'Mai gida na Redis','Redis port'=>'Tashar Redis','Redis database'=>'Bayanan Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Ba kowace shafin da ke kan Redis da aka raba lambarta ta musamman ba, ko kuwa za su goge ma\'ajiyar juna.','Redis password'=>'Kalmar sirri ta Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Bar shi ba komai ba idan Redis ɗinka ba ya buƙatar ɗaya.','Key prefix'=>'Maɓallin prefix','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Madadin wani keɓaɓɓen lambar bayanan sirri lokacin da ba za ka iya samun ɗaya ba.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Tsaftacewa ta atomatik mai wayo','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Share abubuwan da abin ya shafa ta atomatik lokacin da abun ciki ya sauya','After updates'=>'Bayan sabuntawa','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Goge komai bayan sabunta tushe, filogin ko jigom-girma','After a comment'=>'Bayan sharhi','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Share shafin wallafa lokacin da aka amince da sharhi a kansa','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Kashe wannan a kan sashen sharhi mai yawan aiki sosai, inda zai iya share shafi guda daruruwan sau a awa daya.','Never cache these'=>'Kar a taɓa adana waɗannan a ma\'ajiya','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Ana amfani da tsofaffin tsare-tsare masu ma\'ana na WordPress da WooCommerce a duk lokacin da aka yi – ba a taɓa yin caching ɗin karusar sayayya (cart), wurin biya (checkout), shafi na (my-account) da kowane zama (session) da aka shiga ba, komai abin da ke ƙasa.','Addresses'=>'Adireshi','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Hanyar daya a kowane layi, misali <code>/basket</code>. Alamar <code>*</code> a ƙarshe tana dacewa da komai da ke ƙarƙashinta.','Query parameters'=>'Ma\'aunin bincike','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Ba a taba yin ajiyar shafi mai dauke da daya daga cikin wadannan ba — alal misali alamar samfoti ta lokaci guda.','Cookies'=>'Kuki','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Ana ba wa baƙon da ke ɗauke da ɗayan waɗannan sabon shafi a kowane lokaci.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'An cire duk shafukan da aka adana a madadin (cache). Za a sake gina su yayin da masu ziyara suka isa.','The page cache is on, but this server is not LiteSpeed.'=>'An adana shafin yana kunne, amma wannan uwar garken ba LiteSpeed ba ce.','The cache headers are being sent and nothing is reading them, so pages are not actually being cached. Ask your host whether LiteSpeed is available, or move to Zinn® hosting where it is standard.'=>'Ana aika da shugabannin ma\'ajiyar (cache headers) kuma babu wanda ke karanta su, don haka ba a ajiye shukokin a cikin ma\'ajiyar (cache) yadda ya kamata ba. Ka tambayi mai masaukin bako (host) ko LiteSpeed ​​yana samuwa, ko kuma ka koma wurin Zinn® mai masaukin bako inda ya zama daidai.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'An adana abubuwa yana kunne, amma wannan sabar ba ta da goyon bayan Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Ba a shigar da tsawo na phpredis ba, saboda haka ba za a iya amfani da drop-in ba kuma WordPress yana komawa zuwa ma\'ajiya ta cikinsa ta in-memory cache. Tambayi ma\'aikacin bakuncin yanar gizo naka don ya maida phpredis ya yi aiki.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Ba a ajiyewa a cikin ma\'ajiyar wucin gadi komai.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Duka cache biyu a kashe suke, don haka wannan plugin din baya sa shafin ya zama mai sauri ba.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Ana amfani da caching a kan wannan shafin.','Web server'=>'Sabobin yanar gizo','LiteSpeed — page caching available'=>'LiteSpeed — akwai adana shafuka ajiya (caching)','not LiteSpeed — page caching unavailable'=>'ba LiteSpeed ba — ajiyar shafin ba ta da samuwa','Redis support'=>'Goyon bayan Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'an shigar da phpredis','phpredis is not installed'=>'ba a shigar da phpredis ba','Page lifetime'=>'Lokacin shafin','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Ba ka da izinin tsaftace cache.','Cache purge requested.'=>'An nemi tsaftace cache.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: an shigar da wani rukunin raba abu na dabam, don haka wannan plugin din ba ya sarrafa maballin abu na Redis.','detected'=>'an gano','not detected'=>'ba a gano ba','phpredis extension missing'=>'tsawaita phpredis ta ɓace','active'=>'mai aiki','inactive'=>'mara aiki','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Cache na LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Cache na abu na Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Tsawaita PHP na Redis (phpredis) ba ya samuwa a wannan sabar, don haka ba za a iya kunna cache na abu ba.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Wani matatse na adana abubuwa na musamman na abu (object-cache drop-in) an riga an shigar da shi. Cire shi kafin ka kunna Zinn® object cache.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta fayil ɗin saitin haɗin Redis ba.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Ba a iya karanta drop-in na cache na abu da aka haɗa ba.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Ba a iya shigar da drop-in na cache na abu cikin wp-content ba.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Ba a iya cire drop-in na cache na abu ba.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Tsarin fayil na WordPress ba a iya rubuta shi, don haka ba a iya sarrafa drop-in na cache na abu ba.','This one-click login link is not valid any more. Links expire after a couple of minutes and can only be used once — open your site from the Zinn® dashboard again to get a fresh one.'=>'Wannan hanyar haɗi ta shiga ta danna-ɗaya ba ta da aiki yanzu. Hanyoyin haɗi suna ƙarewa bayan mintuna kaɗan kuma ana iya amfani da su sau ɗaya ne kawai — buɗe shafinka daga allon kula na Zinn® kuma don samun sabuwa.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Dubi bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta kasa wucewa binciken amincinta, don haka ba a girka ta ba.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An adana. Buga sabon ƙima don maye gurbinsa.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan jerin...','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan jerin','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan matattara.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara layin da ke sama','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan layin','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — taƙaitaccen bayani','Overview'=>'Bayani gaba ɗaya','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane plugin na Zinn® a wannan rukunin yanar gizon, da ko yana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ba a buƙatar haɗin intanit don wannan plugin ɗin.','Open settings'=>'Buɗe saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ka da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sashen saituna','Support'=>'Tallafi','Save changes'=>'Ajiye sauye-sauye','Tools'=>'Kayayyaki','Export settings'=>'Fitar da saituna','Reset to defaults'=>'Mayar da su zuwa tsoffin kaya','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai dawo da duk wani tsari na wannan plugin zuwa asalin sa. A ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Binciken matsaloli na tallafi','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saiti','Import'=>'Shigo da kaya','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba su taɓa ƙunsar kalmomin sirri, alamomi ko maɓallan API ba — za ka buƙaci sake shigar da su a sabon shafin.','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'An kafa dukkan saitunan da ke kan wannan fagin a matsayin na asali.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Wancan matakin ba shi da samuwa.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba za a iya karanta fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saituna da aka fitar daga wani kari na Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Waccan fayil din yayi yawa sosai don ya zama fitar da saituna.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wancan fayil ba fitar da saitin Zinn® ba ne.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da wannan fayil ɗin ne daga wani plugin daban (%s), don haka shigo da shi nan zai adana saitunan da wannan plugin ɗin bai fahimta ba.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saitin %d. Kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API ba sa cikin fitarwa, don haka a sake shigar da waɗancan.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna %d. Kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API ba sa cikin fitarwa, don haka a sake shigar da waɗancan.','Connected'=>'Haɗe','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma wani abu na bukatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Ana gudanarwa a kan asusunka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan "plugin" ɗin bai faɗi dalili ba. A tura rahoton bincike don mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗi','Last checked %s ago.'=>'An bincika karshe tun %s.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana buɗe a sabon shafin)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan ga tallafin Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Wannan neini daidai abin da za a aika - babu wani abu kuma, kuma babu wani abin da aka boye. Kalmomin sirrinka, alamomin shiga da maɓallan API ba su ciki.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton binciken da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kwafi zuwa allo','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan rahoton ga tallafin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Mun buɗe tikitin goyon baya don ku kuma mun ba da amsa ta imel. Idan ka fi son kada ka aika da shi, kwafi shi a sama kuma ka manna shi a cikin tikiti da kanka.','Copied'=>'An kwafi','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba daga wannan uwar garken (%s). Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti maimakon haka — babu abin da ya lalace game da saitunanka.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An tura rahoton ku zuwa ga goyon bayan Zinn® kuma za su ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Taimakon Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonku — lambar tunani %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Ka aika da rahotanni da yawa a cikin dan kankanin lokaci. Jira \'yan mintoci kaɗan sannan ka sake gwadawa — waɗanda suka gabata sun isa.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta kasa karɓar rahoton a yanzu — matsalar daga ɓangarenmu ce, ba daga gare ku ba. Gwada sake yi ba da daɗewa ba, ko kuma ku kwafi rahoton da ke sama zuwa cikin tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ƙi karɓar rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti, tare da ambaton wannan lambar.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Gojin Zinn® don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa wanda aka gina domin mutanen da suke gudanar da fiye da shafi ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da sayar da shafuka da aka kafa, yankunan yanar gizo da kuma wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi, tare da riƙe kuɗin lafiya har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — hayar mutanen da ke yin wannan don rayuwa','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko buga wani aikin kuma bari su yi gwanjo.','Style preset'=>'Saitin salo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Matsayin mafari. Duk abin da ke ƙasa zai ɓata shi.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girmangu nawa','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma ana amfani da tsarin kamar yadda yake.']];